div(class="space-y-8")
    div(*ngIf="loading", class="flex min-h-[18rem] items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50")
        p(class="text-sm text-slate-500") SLO 정보를 처리하는 중...

    div(*ngIf="mode === 'overview' && !loading", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-orange-600") Single logout
                h2(class="mt-1.5 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950") SAML 로그아웃 확인
                p(class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") 세션을 확인하거나 SP·IdP에서 시작하는 SLO를 각각 실행합니다.
            button(type="button", class="h-10 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50", (click)="loadData()") 새로고침

        nav(class="grid gap-1 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 p-1 sm:grid-cols-3", aria-label="SLO 작업 선택")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="workspaceTabClass('sessions')", (click)="setWorkspaceTab('sessions')") 활성 세션
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="workspaceTabClass('incoming')", (click)="setWorkspaceTab('incoming')") SP 요청 받기
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="workspaceTabClass('outgoing')", (click)="setWorkspaceTab('outgoing')") IdP 요청 보내기

        section(*ngIf="workspaceTab === 'sessions'", class="space-y-4")
            div(class="flex items-end justify-between gap-3")
                div
                    h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") 활성 SAML 세션
                    p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500") 최근 {{activeSessionWindowHours}}시간 안에 발급된 세션만 표시합니다.
                span(class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600") {{activeSessionTotal}}개
            p(*ngIf="activeSessionTotal > activeSessionLimit", class="rounded-xl border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-sky-800") 최근 세션 {{activeSessionLimit}}개만 표시합니다. SP를 선택하면 해당 세션의 SessionIndex를 사용합니다.
            div(*ngIf="activeSessions.length === 0", class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-10 text-center")
                p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700") 활성 세션이 없습니다.
                p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500") 먼저 SAML 로그인을 실행하세요.
            div(*ngIf="activeSessions.length > 0", class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200")
                table(class="w-full min-w-[720px] text-sm")
                    thead
                        tr(class="bg-slate-50 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500")
                            th(class="px-4 py-3") SP
                            th(class="px-4 py-3") 사용자
                            th(class="px-4 py-3") SessionIndex
                            th(class="px-4 py-3") 생성 시각
                            th(class="px-4 py-3 text-right") 작업
                    tbody
                        tr(*ngFor="let session of activeSessions", class="border-t border-slate-100")
                            td(class="max-w-[17rem] break-all px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-slate-700") {{session.sp_entity_id}}
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 text-slate-700") {{session.user_display || session.user_id}}
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-slate-600") {{session.session_index}}
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-slate-500") {{session.created}}
                            td(class="px-4 py-3 text-right")
                                button(type="button", class="rounded-lg border border-rose-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-700 hover:bg-rose-50", (click)="invalidateSession(session.id)") 종료

        section(*ngIf="workspaceTab === 'incoming'", class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem]")
            div(class="space-y-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6")
                div
                    h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") SP LogoutRequest 받기
                    p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500") SP가 보낸 Base64 요청을 확인하고 LogoutResponse를 만듭니다.
                label(class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") SAMLRequest · Base64
                    textarea([(ngModel)]="samlRequestInput", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", rows="9", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-950 p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-100", placeholder="LogoutRequest를 붙여넣으세요.")
                div(class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2")
                    label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Binding
                        select([(ngModel)]="bindingInput", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                            option(value="POST") HTTP-POST
                            option(value="Redirect") HTTP-Redirect
                    label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") RelayState
                        input([(ngModel)]="relayStateInput", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm", placeholder="선택 사항")
                details(class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50")
                    summary(class="cursor-pointer px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-900") 호환 시험
                    label(class="flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-amber-200 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-800")
                        input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="allowUnsignedLogout", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-amber-300 text-amber-600")
                        span 서명 없는 LogoutRequest 허용. 실제 브라우저 SLO가 아닌 이전 시스템 확인에만 사용하세요.
                div(class="flex justify-end")
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="!samlRequestInput.trim()", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-orange-600 disabled:opacity-50", (click)="parseLogoutRequest()") 요청 확인
            aside(class="h-fit rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6")
                h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") 확인 항목
                ul(class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600")
                    li ID·Issuer·Destination
                    li IssueInstant·NotOnOrAfter
                    li NameID·SessionIndex
                    li Binding별 signature

        section(*ngIf="workspaceTab === 'outgoing'", class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem]")
            div(class="space-y-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6")
                div
                    h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") IdP LogoutRequest 보내기
                    p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500") SP와 NameID를 선택해 IdP에서 로그아웃을 시작합니다.
                label(class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") SP
                    select([(ngModel)]="selectedSpId", (ngModelChange)="onSpChange()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                        option(value="") SP를 선택하세요
                        option(*ngFor="let sp of spList", [value]="sp.id") {{sp.entity_id}}
                div(class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2")
                    label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") NameID 값
                        input([(ngModel)]="nameidValue", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm", placeholder="alice@example.com")
                    label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") NameID Format
                        select([(ngModel)]="nameidFormat", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                            option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:1.1:nameid-format:emailAddress") emailAddress
                            option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:nameid-format:persistent") persistent
                            option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:nameid-format:transient") transient
                            option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:1.1:nameid-format:unspecified") unspecified
                div(class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2")
                    label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Binding
                        select([(ngModel)]="idpBinding", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                            option(value="POST") HTTP-POST
                            option(value="REDIRECT") HTTP-Redirect
                    label(class="flex items-center gap-3 self-end rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700")
                        input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="signLogoutRequest", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-500")
                        span LogoutRequest 서명
                div(class="flex flex-wrap justify-end gap-3")
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="!selectedSpId || !nameidValue", class="h-10 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 disabled:opacity-50", (click)="buildIdpLogoutRequest()") 요청만 생성
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="!selectedSpId || !nameidValue", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-orange-600 disabled:opacity-50", (click)="sendIdpLogoutRequest()") SP로 전송
            aside(class="h-fit rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6")
                h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") 사용되는 값
                p(class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") 선택한 SP의 SLO endpoint와 활성 세션의 SessionIndex를 자동으로 사용합니다.

    div(*ngIf="mode === 'respond' && !loading", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100", aria-label="SLO 화면으로", (click)="showOverview()")
                svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") SP 요청 받기 / 확인 결과
                h2(class="mt-0.5 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950") LogoutResponse 설정
        div(class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[18rem_minmax(0,1fr)]")
            aside(class="h-fit space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6")
                div
                    p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") Issuer
                    p(class="mt-2 break-all text-sm font-bold leading-6 text-slate-900") {{parsedLogoutRequest?.issuer}}
                span(class="inline-flex rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold", [class]="parsedLogoutRequest?.standards_status === 'standard' ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800'") {{parsedLogoutRequest?.standards_status === 'standard' ? '표준 요청' : '호환 시험 요청'}}
                ul(*ngIf="parsedLogoutRequest?.compatibility_warnings?.length", class="space-y-1 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-3 text-xs leading-5 text-amber-900")
                    li(*ngFor="let warning of parsedLogoutRequest.compatibility_warnings") {{warning}}
                dl(class="space-y-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 text-sm")
                    div
                        dt(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Request ID
                        dd(class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs text-slate-700") {{parsedLogoutRequest?.request_id}}
                    div
                        dt(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") NameID
                        dd(class="mt-1 break-all text-slate-700") {{parsedLogoutRequest?.nameid_value || '없음'}}
                    div
                        dt(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") 매칭 세션
                        dd(class="mt-1 font-semibold text-slate-900") {{parsedLogoutRequest?.matched_sessions?.length || 0}}개
            section(class="space-y-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6")
                div
                    h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") 응답 값
                    p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500") 정상 응답은 서명을 포함해 반환합니다.
                label(class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700")
                    input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="signLogoutResponse", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-500")
                    span LogoutResponse 서명
                label(class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Status
                    select([(ngModel)]="logoutStatusCode", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                        option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:status:Success") Success
                        option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:status:Requester") Requester Error
                        option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:status:Responder") Responder Error
                div(class="flex justify-end")
                    button(type="button", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-orange-600", (click)="buildLogoutResponse()") 응답 생성 및 세션 종료

    div(*ngIf="mode === 'result' && !loading", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100", aria-label="SLO 화면으로", (click)="showOverview()")
                svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") SP 요청 받기 / 완료
                h2(class="mt-0.5 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950") LogoutResponse 생성 결과
        div(class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2")
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Status
                p(class="mt-1 break-all text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") {{result?.status_code}}
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Destination
                p(class="mt-1 break-all text-sm text-slate-700") {{result?.destination || '없음'}}
        details(class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50")
            summary(class="cursor-pointer px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800") LogoutResponse 원문
            div(class="space-y-4 border-t border-slate-200 p-5")
                div
                    div(class="mb-2 flex justify-between gap-2")
                        label(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700") Base64
                        button(type="button", class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700", (click)="copyText(result?.response_b64)") 복사
                    textarea(readonly="", [value]="result?.response_b64 || ''", rows="4", class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-5")
                div
                    div(class="mb-2 flex justify-between gap-2")
                        label(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700") XML
                        button(type="button", class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700", (click)="copyText(result?.response_xml)") 복사
                    textarea(readonly="", [value]="result?.response_xml || ''", rows="10", class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-950 p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-5 text-slate-100")

    div(*ngIf="mode === 'idp-result' && !loading", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100", aria-label="SLO 화면으로", (click)="showOverview()")
                svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") IdP 요청 보내기 / 완료
                h2(class="mt-0.5 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950") LogoutRequest 생성 결과
        div(class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2")
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") NameID
                p(class="mt-1 break-all text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") {{result?.nameid_value}}
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Destination
                p(class="mt-1 break-all text-sm text-slate-700") {{result?.destination || 'SP에 SLO endpoint 없음'}}
        div(*ngIf="result?.standards_status === 'compatibility'", class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm text-amber-900")
            p(class="font-semibold") 호환 시험으로 생성됨
            ul(*ngIf="result?.compatibility_warnings?.length", class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5")
                li(*ngFor="let warning of result.compatibility_warnings") {{warning}}
        details(class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50")
            summary(class="cursor-pointer px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800") LogoutRequest 원문
            div(class="space-y-4 border-t border-slate-200 p-5")
                div
                    div(class="mb-2 flex justify-between gap-2")
                        label(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700") Base64
                        button(type="button", class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700", (click)="copyText(result?.request_b64)") 복사
                    textarea(readonly="", [value]="result?.request_b64 || ''", rows="4", class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-5")
                div
                    div(class="mb-2 flex justify-between gap-2")
                        label(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700") XML
                        button(type="button", class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700", (click)="copyText(result?.request_xml)") 복사
                    textarea(readonly="", [value]="result?.request_xml || ''", rows="10", class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-950 p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-5 text-slate-100")
